---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Run[Run state]
    Chunk[Chunk state]
    Execution[Execution state]
    Attempt[Attempt state]
    Outbox[Outbox ledger]
    Delivery[Delivery queue]
    Plan[Immutable blob plan and compact admission checkpoints]
    Receipt[Immutable chunk settlements]
    Summary[Shard progress and sealed scorecards]

    Create([Run create])
    Coordinator[Coordinator]
    Worker[Worker]
    Cancel([Run cancel])
    Queue[Queue publication]

    Create --> Run
    Create --> Plan
    Plan -->|verified admission| Chunk
    Coordinator -->|resumes requested admission| Plan

    Coordinator --> Run
    Coordinator --> Outbox
    Coordinator --> Delivery
    Coordinator --> Queue

    Worker --> Chunk
    Worker --> Execution
    Worker --> Attempt
    Worker -->|terminal chunk transaction| Receipt
    Cancel -->|settles remaining chunks| Receipt
    Coordinator -->|folds receipts| Summary
    Receipt --> Summary
    Summary -->|exact seals allow finalization| Run

    Cancel --> Run
    Cancel --> Chunk
    Cancel --> Execution
    Cancel --> Attempt
    Cancel --> Outbox
    Cancel --> Delivery

    Run -->|dispatch guard| Chunk
    Chunk -->|work ownership| Execution
    Execution -->|current attempt guard| Attempt
    Run -->|state-change events| Outbox
    Outbox -->|enqueue delivery row| Delivery
    Delivery -->|publish or retry| Queue

    class Create,Cancel command
    class Coordinator,Worker system
    class Run,Chunk,Execution,Attempt,Outbox,Delivery,Plan,Receipt,Summary component
    class Queue external
